            "text": "```json\n{\n  \"findings\": [\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Anti-Assignment\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"All rights (under any applicable intellectual property right) granted herein are not sublicenseable,\\n\\nSource: 2THEMART COM INC, 10-12G, 8/26/1999\\n\\n\\n\\n\\n\\ntransferable or assignable.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"Notwithstanding the foregoing, either party may use a third party web host, but all actions or failures to act of the web host that would be a breach of this Agreement, were the actions or failures to act taken by the applicable party, shall be deemed a breach of this Agreement.  In addition, 2TheMart may grant sublicenses to companies that 2TheMart has a business relationship with to the extent that 2TheMart Content is visible from such company's web-site through a link or other means.\",\n      \"note\": \"Section 6.5 prohibits the assignment, transfer, or sublicensing of intellectual property rights granted under the agreement, but permits third-party web hosting, specified sublicensing by 2TheMart, and reorganizations as detailed in the Corporate Reorganisations clause.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Change Of Control\",\n      \"characterization\": \"QUALIFIED\",\n      \"quote\": \"If a majority of the equity securities of either 2TheMart or i-Escrow, Inc. (except that i-Escrow may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow.com, and i-Escrow.com may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow's existing shareholders, without triggering the foregoing) are acquired by another company during the term of this Agreement either company may terminate this Agreement, without liability, by giving a thirty (30) days written notice to the other party.\",\n      \"overrideQuote\": \"except that i-Escrow may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow.com, and i-Escrow.com may sell all or a majority of its equity securities or voting interests to i-Escrow's existing shareholders, without triggering the foregoing\",\n      \"note\": \"Section 8.3 grants either party the right to terminate upon an acquisition of a majority of equity securities by another company, with a specific carve-out for internal reorganizations involving i-Escrow.com and i-Escrow's existing shareholders.\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"clauseType\": \"Exclusivity\",\n      \"characterization\": \"NOT_FOUND\",\n      \"quote\": null,\n      \"overrideQuote\": null,\n      \"note\": \"The contract does not include an exclusivity clause; the licenses granted are expressly non-exclusive, although Section 2.4 contains a limited restriction prohibiting i-Escrow from running banner advertisements for competitors of 2TheMart.\"\n    }\n  ]\n}\n```",
